{"ID":"20250806131531-oy2re0q","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250806131531-oy2re0q","title":"UPL2——Unity Profiler","type":"doc","updated":"20250915113143"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806132255-ay57ofc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250806132255-ay57ofc","updated":"20250806132631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity Profiler"}]},{"ID":"20250806132616-bdecicd","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250806132616-bdecicd","updated":"20250806132631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250806132618-6wpmmxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806132618-6wpmmxz","updated":"20250806132618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Profiler 记录应用程序性能的多个方面并显示相关信息。使用此信息可以做出有关应用程序中可能需要优化的事项的明智决策，并确认所做的优化是否产生预期结果。"}]},{"ID":"20250806132618-3iv89br","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806132618-3iv89br","updated":"20250806132631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"默认情况下，Profiler 会记录并保存游戏最近的 300 帧，并向您显示每帧的详细信息。您可以在“首选项”窗口（菜单：编辑 \u003e 首选项）中增加其记录的帧数，最多可增加到 2000 帧。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注意：如果将此设置增加到较大的帧数，Profiler 的开销和内存使用量可能会显著增加，从而对性能产生更大影响。"}]},{"ID":"20250806132618-fvvus38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806132618-fvvus38","updated":"20250806132624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以检查脚本代码，以及应用程序如何使用某些资源（这可能会降低应用程序速度）。还可以比较应用程序在不同设备上的性能。\n性能分析器具有几个不同的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://docs.unity.cn/cn/2022.3/Manual/ProfilerWindow.html#modules","TextMarkTextContent":"性能分析器模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这些模块可以添加到性能分析会话中，从而获取有关渲染、内存和音频等方面的更多信息。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250806131531-9655szt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250806131531-9655szt","updated":"20250806132433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如何打开性能分析器窗口"}]},{"ID":"20250806131830-259v1z1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806131830-259v1z1","updated":"20250806131920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Window ——\u003e Analysis ——\u003e Profiler 或 Profiler（Standalone Process）"}]},{"ID":"20250806131921-02dvxnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806131921-02dvxnj","updated":"20250806131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250806131939-429o3te.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250806131914-v2y4fu9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250806131914-v2y4fu9","updated":"20250903210453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"了解两种分析器窗口的区别"}]},{"ID":"20250806132220-afpi2hb","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20250806132220-afpi2hb","updated":"20250903210453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"col"},{"ID":"20250806132006-4mg0azo","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250806132006-4mg0azo","updated":"20250903210453"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806132010-umkv951","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250806132010-umkv951","updated":"20250806132028"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806132010-cifuqgx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806132010-cifuqgx","updated":"20250806132010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Profiler:"}]},{"ID":"20250806132016-k57j58t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806132016-k57j58t","updated":"20250806132028"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内嵌在 Unity 编辑器中的性能分析工具，默认使用，方便调试\n它同属 Unity Editor 进程，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"会对游戏性能造成一定干扰（特别是深度采样或低端设备）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n更适合日常开发调试、小项目、局部功能分析"}]}]},{"ID":"20250806132013-rpuiuti","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250806132013-rpuiuti","updated":"20250903210453"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806132013-n6bm87f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806132013-n6bm87f","updated":"20250903210453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Profiler (Standalone Process)："}]},{"ID":"20250806132014-k9oepxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806132014-k9oepxc","updated":"20250806132014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"独立运行的分析器，可最大限度减少对被分析游戏的性能干扰，更适合真实测试\n更适合复杂场景、大型项目、真机性能分析"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250806132050-8idxug5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806132050-8idxug5","updated":"20250806132220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250806132217-cavcwdz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20250806132222-iiq0xl7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250806132222-iiq0xl7","updated":"20250915113143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Profiler 窗口中的各模块"}]},{"ID":"20250808143148-t5b0aad","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250808143148-t5b0aad","updated":"20250915113143"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250808143149-17mpl69","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250808143149-17mpl69","updated":"20250808143149"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250808143149-2htr3qa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250808143149-2htr3qa","updated":"20250808143332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250808143332-zggv4qq","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"顶部页签"}]}]},{"ID":"20250808152347-rzvv6tm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250808152347-rzvv6tm","updated":"20250815152815"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250808152347-a6zry78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250808152347-a6zry78","updated":"20250815152815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250808153012-fa01ash","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"CPU Usage 模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（每一帧 CPU 所花费的时间，按类别详细划分不同系统的消耗情况）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250808152356-reekou3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250808152356-reekou3","updated":"20250815152801"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250808152356-tlxuqjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250808152356-tlxuqjm","updated":"20250815152801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250815141326-vo9owdq","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"GPU Usage 模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（分析 GPU 在一帧中在哪些渲染阶段上花了多少时间）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250808152404-08nli1t","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250808152404-08nli1t","updated":"20250815152746"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250808152404-wgv9bw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250808152404-wgv9bw0","updated":"20250815152746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250815150316-zpn5tfw","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Rendering 模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（查看一帧渲染时的数据量，例如一帧内 Drawcall 数量，合批数量，提交的三角面和顶点数量等等）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250808152414-upibbj5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250808152414-upibbj5","updated":"20250901203538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250808152414-zyvk96y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250808152414-zyvk96y","updated":"20250901203538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250815154003-pyrzco5","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Memory 模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（查看一帧内存占用量粗略数据，可以看到这一帧不同类型的数据各自占用了多少内存，开发中持续观察性能）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250808152419-c4fdjk4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250808152419-c4fdjk4","updated":"20250901203547"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250808152419-grofax9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250808152419-grofax9","updated":"20250901203547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250828200427-ljck1t6","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Memory Profiler Package"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（可以在某一帧拍摄内存快照，详细分析各种类型的数据占用了多少内存，精细到对象引用关系、类型大小、堆分布等，排查具体内存泄漏 / 激增问题）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250808152457-uuovq0v","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250808152457-uuovq0v","updated":"20250901203601"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250808152457-ulcbwra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250808152457-ulcbwra","updated":"20250901203601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250829113816-we9gknx","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Audio 模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（分析和监控音频系统的性能表现，包括音频播放、混音、音量、CPU 占用等关键信息）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250808152511-5xbscaf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250808152511-5xbscaf","updated":"20250901203620"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250808152511-vh4bxdk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250808152511-vh4bxdk","updated":"20250901203620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250901202410-t9zuf1p","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Video 模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（分析游戏中视频播放性能和资源使用情况，排查和视频相关的问题）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250808152516-c41or4d","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250808152516-c41or4d","updated":"20250903105445"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250808152516-gl624lc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250808152516-gl624lc","updated":"20250903105445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250902195926-0tkhu1p","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Physics 模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（监控 3D 物理系统运行状态与性能开销，涵盖 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Rigidbody"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Collider"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、碰撞检测、物理查询等运行时数据，排查 3D 物理相关问题）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250808152527-mgalvah","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250808152527-mgalvah","updated":"20250903105516"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250808152527-3qb9jsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250808152527-3qb9jsk","updated":"20250903105516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250902203726-7d6vy2m","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Physics 2D 模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（分析和排查 2D 物理系统的性能与行为，排查 2D 物理相关问题）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250808152618-kt8srfk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250808152618-kt8srfk","updated":"20250915113143"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250808152618-2np799b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250808152618-2np799b","updated":"20250915113143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250903105320-tef3pn1","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"UI 和 UI Details 模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（分析和优化 Unity 中 UI 系统性能）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250808152630-xzgwfxt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250808152630-xzgwfxt","updated":"20250903195925"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250808152630-juliasy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250808152630-juliasy","updated":"20250903195925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250903195925-yx940z1","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Realtime GI 模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（实时全局光照）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250808152651-gtvae64","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250808152651-gtvae64","updated":"20250903201222"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250808152651-iui7q6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250808152651-iui7q6c","updated":"20250903201222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250903201222-ho9h4t0","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Virtual Texturing 模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（虚拟纹理）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250808152704-2i8ljf6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250808152704-2i8ljf6","updated":"20250903203316"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250808152704-6y9hcxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250808152704-6y9hcxc","updated":"20250903203316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250903203316-hm4ybix","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"File Access 模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（文件访问）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250808152716-f83hqit","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250808152716-f83hqit","updated":"20250903205534"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250808152716-edawu0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250808152716-edawu0s","updated":"20250903205534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250903205534-nsucpcy","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Asset Loading 模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（资源加载）"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250808143329-zpoodjs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250808143329-zpoodjs","updated":"20250915112118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为何要学习 Profiler"}]},{"ID":"20250915112025-7va26ui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915112025-7va26ui","updated":"20250915112036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当我们的项目出现性能问题时，我们一定不能凭感觉去解决问题！\n这些性能分析工具可以帮助我们：定位问题！发现问题！解决问题！\n因为问题的本质就是数据的异常，通过这些性能分析工具，我们可以非常直观的发现异常数据（问题）出现在哪个模块从而发现并定位问题，并根据具体异常的数据制定解决方案"}]},{"ID":"20250915112040-6cdojmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915112040-6cdojmz","updated":"20250915112040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如："}]},{"ID":"20250915112043-ebnsml8","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250915112043-ebnsml8","updated":"20250915112043"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915112043-nchr2ps","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250915112043-nchr2ps","updated":"20250915112043"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915112043-zo9nhn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915112043-zo9nhn5","updated":"20250915112043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是什么造成的CPU、GPU消耗高了，让游戏出现卡顿问题"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915112044-0v9bau8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250915112044-0v9bau8","updated":"20250915112044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915112044-biedrjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915112044-biedrjc","updated":"20250915112045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是什么造成内存占用过大，让游戏出现闪退问题"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250915112046-556h9uy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915112046-556h9uy","updated":"20250915112046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20250915112041-ek23wlg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915112041-ek23wlg","updated":"20250915112041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此之所以要学习他们，就是因为性能分析工具可以提升我们解决问题的效率！也就提升了开发效率！"}]},{"ID":"20250915112118-0b9eb34","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250915112118-0b9eb34","updated":"20250915112227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用时的注意事项"}]},{"ID":"20250915112129-av7y63l","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915112129-av7y63l","updated":"20250915112227"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915112138-9zrzkc4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915112138-9zrzkc4","updated":"20250915112138"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915112138-c2vsqgx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915112138-c2vsqgx","updated":"20250915112138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"应该在性能出现问题时再针对问题去进行分析处理"}]},{"ID":"20250915112140-1uoyqvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915112140-1uoyqvr","updated":"20250915112140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"避免盲目优化，关注实际体验问题"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915112138-r50htbx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250915112138-r50htbx","updated":"20250915112138"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915112138-990d69s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915112138-990d69s","updated":"20250915112138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"应该尽量在真机上进行测试分析"}]},{"ID":"20250915112142-t7qjyf3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915112142-t7qjyf3","updated":"20250915112142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"编辑器与真机表现差异大，尤其在移动端、IL2CPP、GPU 方面"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915112138-4h25wkz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250915112138-4h25wkz","updated":"20250915112227"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915112138-xdxxjzd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915112138-xdxxjzd","updated":"20250915112138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"确保使用 Development Build 并启用 Profiler 相关选项"}]},{"ID":"20250915112143-0t5mh6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915112143-0t5mh6g","updated":"20250915112143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样我们才能利用性能分析工具进行真机调试"}]},{"ID":"20250915112153-kbvfqos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915112